# EPFL Design System (Cursor rule)

The full, canonical rules live in **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root — read it. This
rule exists so Cursor surfaces the essentials when editing UI files.

## Always

- Author against design tokens: `var(--primary)`, `var(--fg)`, `var(--space-*)`,
  `var(--radius)`, `var(--font-sans)`. **No raw hex, no raw `px`** (use `rem` or a
  token). Raw values live only in `tokens/colors_and_type.css`.
- Font is **Suisse Int'l** only (Arial fallback is built into `--font-sans`).
- Use the canonical `.epfl-*` classes from `css/epfl.css`; in framework projects
  import components from a kit's `index.js` (`kits/vue`, `kits/react`, …), never
  from internals.

## Never

- No raw colors/px, no fonts other than Suisse Int'l.
- No emoji, no gradients, no card drop-shadows (borders > shadows), no hover
  lift/scale, no Title Case (use sentence case).

See `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` for the why and the full spec.
